  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-LCD-1.47/ESP32-S3-LCD-1.47-Demo.zip). Colour order: the Arduino demo sets MADCTL 0x00 (RGB) with LCM control C0=0x2C; the IDF demo sets the BGR bit in MADCTL but also C0=0x80, whose XOR-BGR bit flips it back, so both end up RGB on the glass - recorded rgb.",
